%% commit ede6774 · stage 3 of the capture path: every change the reply makes to task and goal rows before the save. Steps and the fields written are in the tables on the page.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(14,111,111,0.10) App code
    participant SEND as HomeTabView.swift<br/>sendMessage
    participant WRITER as CaptureWriter.swift<br/>apply
    participant FOLLOW as HomeTabView.swift<br/>commitmentStartDayFollowUp
    participant TASKS as NudgeTask rows<br/>NudgeTask.swift
    participant GOALS as NudgeGoal rows<br/>NudgeGoal.swift
    participant LOG as Capture log file<br/>CaptureHistoryExporter.swift
  end
  SEND->>TASKS: apply task_updates
  SEND->>GOALS: recordActivity
  SEND->>WRITER: apply
  WRITER->>TASKS: clear sequenceIndex
  WRITER->>TASKS: delete replaced duplicate
  WRITER->>TASKS: insert rows
  WRITER->>LOG: append line (DEBUG)
  WRITER-->>SEND: returns CaptureWriteResult
  SEND->>FOLLOW: created rows
  FOLLOW->>TASKS: write start-day fields
  FOLLOW-->>SEND: returns sentence or nil
